Description: |
  Documents Nest's dependency-injection container: the module graph, the per-class
  resolution algorithm, the per-instance wrapper, and the bootstrap loader — the
  foundation every other subsystem (router, microservices, websockets, testing)
  builds on to look up or create instances.
